shadcn-admin – https://github.com/satnaing/shadcn-admin (commit e16c87f)
  Copyright (c) 2024 Sat Naing – MIT License
  What was copied and adapted (class names translated to our colour tokens, texts
  moved to i18n, some props added):
  - frontend/src/components/shadcn/*: sidebar, button, dropdown-menu, popover, tooltip,
    dialog, sheet, command, separator (the template's copies of shadcn/ui components);
